sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Student
    participant B as Backend (Go Gin)
    participant Q as SubmissionQueue<br/>(1 worker, cap 256, 30s timeout)
    participant P as quiz_exec_rw pool<br/>(LOGIN role, NOINHERIT)
    participant DB as Postgres<br/>(sandbox_exam_{id} / sandbox_exam_cat_{id})

    S->>B: POST /quiz/submit (DML)
    B->>B: Fetch question, verify effective_state=active + enrolled
    B->>B: normalizeSmartQuotes(student_sql)
    B->>Q: Run(ctx, evaluate)
    Note over Q: Non-blocking send.<br/>Full → ErrQueueFull → HTTP 503

    rect rgb(220, 240, 220)
        Note right of Q: Phase 2: serialised evaluation (one exam DML at a time)
        Q->>P: Acquire connection (never the privileged app pool)
        P->>DB: BEGIN
        Q->>DB: pg_advisory_xact_lock_shared(schema)  -- blocks a concurrent rebuild
        Q->>DB: SAVEPOINT student_eval
        Q->>DB: SET LOCAL search_path = <schema>, public, pg_temp
        Note over Q,DB: pg_temp named LAST (ARCH-023): a student<br/>CREATE TEMP TABLE cannot shadow target_table
        Q->>DB: SET LOCAL ROLE exam_student
        opt seed_sql or auto_seed present
            Q->>DB: apply lecturer seed_sql, else the derived AutoSeedPlan INSERT
            Note over Q,DB: Must run AFTER SET LOCAL ROLE — login roles are NOINHERIT.<br/>Seed failure → rollback → status=error, not HTTP 500
        end
        Q->>DB: Execute student DML
        DB-->>Q: (writes applied to sandbox)
        Q->>DB: SELECT * FROM target_table  -- post-image
        DB-->>Q: Captured rows
        Q->>DB: ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT student_eval
        Note over Q,DB: ROLLBACK FIRST, then RESET ROLE (ARCH-021):<br/>an aborted tx rejects every other statement
        Q->>DB: RESET ROLE
        Q->>DB: COMMIT
        Note over Q,DB: Sandbox restored byte-identically<br/>for the next student in the queue
    end

    Q-->>B: ValidationResult (status, captured post-image)
    Note over B: decideDMLStatus: multiset diff of post-images<br/>against cached expected_result.<br/>Column names folded to lowercase.<br/>No ordering or column-order gate on DML.<br/>Teacher SQL is never re-executed.
    B->>DB: INSERT INTO app.submissions

    alt status = correct
        B-->>S: 200 OK · status=correct · full points
    else status = incorrect (single-schema)
        B-->>S: 200 OK · 0 points · row-level missing/extra diff
    else status = incorrect (dual_schema)
        B-->>S: 200 OK · 0 points · generic message (no decoy/grading data leaked)
    else status = syntax_error
        B-->>S: 200 OK · 0 points · engine error detail
    else seed replay failed
        B-->>S: 200 OK · status=error · "question could not be prepared"
    else queue full
        B-->>S: 503 · "submission queue is full"
    else per-job timeout (30s)
        B-->>S: 504 · "submission timed out"
    end
